{
  "//": [
    "Lineage: partly generated. Each app's upstream block is generated by design/upstream-fetch (stage 1, `mise run upstream:fetch` in design/) from GitHub; never edit it by hand. Everything else is written by hand (stage 3, record), by whoever maintains this repo.",
    "Each app holds only what is its own: id, name, the exact version pinned, its control port once checked, overrides (only where it differs from design/family.json, so every uncommon thing is listed there), problems (numbers into docs/problems.md, described once there), notes, upstream, and observed.",
    "observed is the evidence of checking the app end to end: the version and date checked, its usage line, bundle and process name, what a freshly opened app holds, tools only its live server has, the tools for looking at the result, whether the CLI can confine file access (--automation-read-root / --automation-write-root) and where it keeps its control token. An app with observed is checked. observed is written by design/app-check (stage 2, `mise run app:check <app>` in design/), except opens_with and control_token, which are recorded by hand.",
    "Read by: the validate stage in design/mise.toml (stage 4), design/config-generate (stage 5), and mise-tasks/apps/status. Generates, through design/config-generate with design/family.json: the repo root's mise.toml and servers.json (and mise.lock follows from mise.toml)."
  ],
